"<p>Quick guide to the tabs on this page -- a client's financial and contract picture, plus a combined lookup.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Client Summary</b> -- type a client name for a one-page overview: details, financials, contracts, tickets, and security alerts all in one place.</li>\n<li><b>Contract Services</b> -- pick a month (optionally filter by client/service name) to see active contract service/bundle items billed that month.</li>\n<li><b>Client Financials</b> -- type a client name for their last 12 months of invoiced amounts, broken down by category (Labour, Recurring Services, Charges, etc.), plus a list of individual invoices. An unpaid invoice (no Date Paid recorded in Autotask) shows a red warning icon.</li>\n<li><b>Check Client</b> -- a combined, read-only lookup of Orders, Subscriptions, and Contract Services for one client, so you don't need to visit three separate pages.</li>\n</ul>"